{"name":"Mako","hex":"#505555","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Mako","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Alternative form of Maku (“Amazon peoples”)."]},{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["Alternative form of Maku (“languages”)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Mako"}],"entries":[{"title":"Aristotelia serrata","blocks":[{"text":"Aristotelia serrata, commonly known as wineberry and makomako, is a species of small tree in the family Elaeocarpaceae. It is a fast-growing dioecious tree which can be semideciduous. It is endemic to New Zealand. Its range mainly covers the North, South, and Stewart Islands. A. serrata is typically found in lowland to montane environments, and the plant can freely colonise disturbed areas. The tree can reach up to 10 metres tall, with a trunk diameter of up to 30 cm (12 in). The bark is grey or pale brown and smooth."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/Aristotelia_serrata_-_Michael_Berardozzi_-_244014622.jpeg/330px-Aristotelia_serrata_-_Michael_Berardozzi_-_244014622.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aristotelia_serrata","wikidata":"Q151178"},{"title":"Mako shark","blocks":[{"text":"Mako sharks are predatory mackerel sharks of the genus Isurus. They are largely pelagic, and are fast, predatory fish capable of swimming at speeds of up to 50 km/h (31 mph). The two species of mako sharks are sexually dimorphic, with females being larger than males, and are large sharks. Both species are classified as \"Endangered\" by the IUCN."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8e/Shortfin_mako_swfsc.jpg/330px-Shortfin_mako_swfsc.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mako_shark","wikidata":"Q171298"},{"title":"Mako (actor)","blocks":[{"text":"Makoto Iwamatsu  was a Japanese-American actor, credited mononymously in almost all of his acting roles as simply Mako . His career in film, on television, and on stage spanned five decades and 165 productions. He was nominated for an Academy Award, Golden Globe Award, and a Tony Award."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c5/Mako%2C_1986.jpg/330px-Mako%2C_1986.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mako_(actor)","wikidata":"Q318885"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d7/Aristotelia_serrata_249259500.jpg/250px-Aristotelia_serrata_249259500.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d7/Aristotelia_serrata_249259500.jpg/500px-Aristotelia_serrata_249259500.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d7/Aristotelia_serrata_249259500.jpg/250px-Aristotelia_serrata_249259500.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAristotelia_serrata_249259500.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b3/Aristotelia_serrata_kz5.jpg/250px-Aristotelia_serrata_kz5.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b3/Aristotelia_serrata_kz5.jpg/500px-Aristotelia_serrata_kz5.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b3/Aristotelia_serrata_kz5.jpg/250px-Aristotelia_serrata_kz5.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAristotelia_serrata_kz5.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8c/Aristotelia_serrata_-_John_Barkla_-_255